# Sample Ooda CLI Build Invocation

File: ooda/examples/build.oot

## Build a .oo file

```sh
ooda build src/main.oo --target c -o build/main
```

This invokes `ooda/build/host_build.oo::run_oodac_build` with rest `["src/main.oo", "--target", "c", "-o", "build/main"]`. Requires `OODA_COMPILER`.

## Run a .oo file

```sh
ooda run src/main.oo
```

This invokes `ooda/build/host_build.oo::run_oodac_run`.

## Time a .oo file

```sh
ooda bench src/main.oo --run
```

This invokes `ooda/build/bench.oo::run_ooda_bench` and prints `ooda bench: check src/main.oo Nms` and (if --run) `ooda bench: run src/main.oo Nms`.
